<title>CYPRUS: Philiki Estates first-half profit rises.</title>
<headline>Philiki Estates first-half profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(In thousands of Cyprus pounds)</p>
<p>					 1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		     960,895    vs    360,300</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     73,151     vs     54,726</p>
<p>    Tax			    15,338     vs     10,945</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	   57,813     vs     43,781</p>
<p>    Earnings per share(cents)   2.9     vs	  2.8</p>
<p>NOTE - In a statement Philiki Estates described their H1 results 'satisfactory judging by the financial recession in the construction market'.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
